This page contains online material, notes and photos about the topics presented in the ScicosLab Training course in Malaysia.

The course has been done by [[http://www.tritytech.com/ Trity Technologies]], which is a company making training in malaysia about model based design including ScicosLab, and the ScicosLab-FLEX toolbox

